IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `DBS Rewards Terms and Conditions — The DBS Rewards Redemption Programme`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. dbs-rewards-programme-tnc: "DBS Rewards Terms and Conditions: The
-- DBS Rewards Redemption Programme", cl.1-14, "Last Updated: Sep 2026" on every
-- page (DBS Bank Ltd). The programme terms that the DBS Woman's Card T&C apply
-- (cl.6: "DBS Rewards Programme Terms and Conditions apply") and incorporate
-- (cl.12: overseas spend excludes "transactions which are excluded from the
-- awarding of DBS Points as set out in the DBS Rewards Programme Terms and
-- Conditions"). Held as role `instrument`: it is the text the Woman's Card terms
-- are made under. It post-dates the Woman's Card terms (27 July 2026) and was
-- not held when the first row of this subject was written.
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS THAT BEARS ON EARN.
--   cl.1.1(a)-(b) The Programme excludes, among others, "DBS yuu Card" and "POSB
--                 Mastercard Credit/Debit Cards": a yuu Card and a PAssion card
--                 do not earn DBS Points at all.
--   cl.2.1      "DBS Points shall be awarded to the Principal Cardmember based on
--               the amount of retail purchases charged to the Card Account on a
--               per transaction basis, rounded down to the nearest whole number."
--   cl.2.3      1 DBS Point for every S$5 spend on each DBS Credit Card, with
--               named exceptions, including (e) DBS Woman's Platinum Cardmembers
--               5 DBS Points for every S$5 online spend, capped at S$1,000 a
--               calendar month, and (f) DBS Woman's World Cardmembers 10 DBS
--               Points for every S$5 online spend, capped at S$1,000 a calendar
--               month, and 3 for every S$5 equivalent in overseas spend.
--   cl.2.5-2.6  "Local spend is identified as card transactions charged in
--               Singapore Dollars." "Overseas spend is identified as card
--               transactions charged in foreign currencies."
--   cl.2.8      DBS Points will not be awarded for (a) the MCCs of Table 1; (b)
--               the descriptions of Table 2; (c) posted 0% Interest Instalment
--               Payment Plan monthly transactions; (d) My Preferred Payment Plan
--               monthly transactions; (e) interest, finance charges, cash
--               advances, cash withdrawal, balance transfer, smart cash, AXS
--               payments, SAM online bill payments, bill payments via internet
--               banking and all fees charged by DBS; (f) other transactions DBS
--               determines.
--   cl.10 (miles conversion) "Conversion Rate: KrisFlyer Miles 5,000 DBS Points
--               = 10,000 miles; Asia Miles 5,000 DBS Points = 10,000 miles."
-- The Table 1 here has 44 MCCs. The Woman's Card terms' own Table 1 has 57: the
-- Woman's table adds thirteen codes, so a purchase at, e.g., MCC 7399 earns the
-- Base DBS Point under this document and is not "Online spend" under the Woman's.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.2.8 -- what earns no DBS Points`

-- Table 1: 4784, 4829, 4900, 5047, 5199, 5960, 5993, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6050,
-- 6051, 6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534, 6540, 7349, 7511, 7523,
-- 7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661, 8699, 8999,
-- 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405.
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the DBS Rewards Table 1 category codes` MEANS
    LIST 4784, 4829, 4900, 5047, 5199, 5960, 5993, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6050, 6051,
         6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534, 6540, 7349, 7511, 7523,
         7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661, 8699,
         8999, 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405

-- cl.2.8(c)-(e) by kind of charge. "AXS payments, SAM online bill payments, bill
-- payments via internet banking" are bills through a channel; a bill paid
-- directly on the card is not named.
GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN FALSE

-- Table 2: AMAZE*, AXS*, AXS BizPay*, AXS PTE LTD*, BAGUS*, CANTINE*, EZLINK*,
-- EZ-LINK*, PAYPAL *AXS PTE LTD*, RAZERPAY*, SAM -*, SAM PAYMENTS*, SEDAP*,
-- SGEBIZ*, SHOPEEPAY*, SINGAPORE E-BUSINESS*, SINGTEL DASH*, SMOOVPAY*,
-- TRANSIT 3*, YOUTRIP*.
GIVEN d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the DBS Rewards Table 2 names the description` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `Amaze`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `AXS`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bagus`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cantine`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `EZ-Link`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal AXS Pte Ltd`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Razerpay`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SAM`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sedap`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sgebiz`                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `ShopeePay`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singapore E-Business`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Dash`           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SmoovPay`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `TRANSIT`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Youtrip`                THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                          FALSE

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` p MEANS
    `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`)
    OR `the code is among` p `the DBS Rewards Table 1 category codes`
    OR `the DBS Rewards Table 2 names the description` (p's descriptor)
    OR p's `later reversed`


§§ `cl.2.1, cl.2.3, cl.2.5-2.6, cl.10 -- the points and what they are worth`

-- cl.2.5 and cl.2.6.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is local spend` p MEANS
    p's currency EQUALS `Singapore dollars`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is overseas spend` p MEANS
    NOT (p's currency EQUALS `Singapore dollars`)

-- cl.2.1 and cl.2.3: 1 DBS Point for every S$5, per transaction, rounded down.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` amount MEANS
    FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)

-- cl.10: 5,000 DBS Points convert to 10,000 miles.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`miles per DBS Point` MEANS 2

-- cl.2.3(e), (f): the programme's own statement of the Woman's Platinum and
-- Woman's World rates, per S$5, and the S$1,000 online cap.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`DBS Rewards: Woman's World DBS Points per S$5 of online spend` MEANS 10

GIVETH A NUMBER
`DBS Rewards: Woman's World DBS Points per S$5 of overseas spend` MEANS 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
`DBS Rewards: Woman's Platinum DBS Points per S$5 of online spend` MEANS 5

GIVETH A NUMBER
`DBS Rewards: online spend cap per calendar month in S$` MEANS 1000


§§ `Illustrations`

#ASSERT `the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` 100 EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` 4.99 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` 9.99 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` 5 EQUALS 1

-- cl.10: 5,000 points = 10,000 miles.
#ASSERT 5000 TIMES `miles per DBS Point` EQUALS 10000

-- cl.2.5-2.6.
#ASSERT `the purchase is local spend` `the base purchase`
#ASSERT `the purchase is overseas spend` (`purchase in currency` `the base purchase` `Another foreign currency`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the purchase is overseas spend` `the base purchase`)

-- cl.2.8(a): Table 1 codes; a restaurant is not on it.
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 4784)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7995)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 6381)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 9405)
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` `the base purchase`)
-- ... and the thirteen codes the Woman's Card terms add to the online exclusion are NOT on this table.
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7399))
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 8111))
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 7311))
-- cl.2.8(b): Table 2 descriptions. Youtrip, ShopeePay and Amaze are named; CardUp and IG are not.
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `Youtrip`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `ShopeePay`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `Amaze`)
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `CardUp`))
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase described as` `the base purchase` `IG Markets`))
-- cl.2.8(c)-(e): kinds.
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `Instalment plan charge`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `Cash advance`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `Bill payment`)
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `Fee, interest or finance charge`)
#ASSERT NOT (`DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase of kind` `the base purchase` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`))
#ASSERT `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` (`purchase later reversed` `the base purchase`)

-- cl.2.3(f): 10 DBS Points per S$5 online is 2 DBS Points per S$1 = 4 miles per S$1.
#ASSERT (`DBS Rewards: Woman's World DBS Points per S$5 of online spend` TIMES `miles per DBS Point`) DIVIDED BY 5 EQUALS 4
-- ... and 3 per S$5 overseas is 1.2 miles per S$1.
#ASSERT (`DBS Rewards: Woman's World DBS Points per S$5 of overseas spend` TIMES `miles per DBS Point`) DIVIDED BY 5 EQUALS 1.2
